<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n93636" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σελην-ιακός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>lunar</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐνιαυτός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Num.</u>
					18
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σφαῖρα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					2.376d
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζῴδιον</span>
			<i>that in which the moon is situated</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Vett.Val.
				19.22
			</span></i>. Adv.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κῶς</span>
			<i>by lunar reckoning</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Procl.
				<u>in Prm.</u>
				p.631
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>epileptic</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Alex.Trall.
				1.15
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Orph.
				<u>L.</u>
				50
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάνθαρος ς</span>. <i>a species of
			beetle</i> (cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡλιοκάνθαρος</span>), <i><span class="en">
				<u>PMag.Par.</u>
				1.2456
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				2688
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IV.</b>
			distinguishing epith. of a kind of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κῦφι</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Paul.Aeg.
				3.28
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				7.22
			</span></i>.</div>
